<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank May notes auction schedule.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank May notes auction schedule.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Tuesday it has scheduled weekly auctions in May for a total of 13 billion baht ($500 million) in short-term central bank notes. The following is the auction schedule:</p>
<p>Bangkok of Thailand note auctions:</p>
<p>    Date		   Maturity (Days)	   Amount</p>
<p>							  (million baht)</p>
<p>     2/5/97		   27			 2,000</p>
<p>     2/5/97		   90			 1,000</p>
<p>     2/5/97		  188			 1,000</p>
<p>     9/5/97		   28			 2,000</p>
<p>    16/5/97		   28			 2,000</p>
<p>    16/5/97		   91			 1,000</p>
<p>    23/5/97		   28			 2,000</p>
<p>    30/5/97		   28			 2,000</p>
<p>($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
